      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_649739793bd470d9_0",
        "edit": "Replaced the incorrect sum assignment `assign s=(a|b|ci);` with the correct full-adder XOR sum `assign s=(a^b^ci);`. The carry logic was left unchanged. This fixes the observed value mismatch where the buggy OR-based sum produced 11 instead of the expected 10 at the first divergent cycle.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module fa_behavioral(a,b,ci,s,co);\n       input a,b;\n       input ci;\n       output  s;\n       output co;\n\n\n\n       assign s=(a^b^ci);\n       assign co=((a&b)|(a&ci)|(b&ci));\n\n\n\nendmodule\n",
